{"title":"Garlands","description":"\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDiscover the Perfect Artificial Christmas Garlands for Your Holiday Display\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eArtificial Christmas garland from Carol's Christmas Conifers brings natural looking greenery and festive detail into your holiday décor. Designed to replicate the look and texture of real evergreen foliage our garlands feature durable construction for long lasting seasonal use. \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePerfect for draping over mantels, staircases, doorways, and railings, or simply styling your holiday tablescape. Our Christmas garland makes it easy to create a cohesive and polished holiday look throughout your home. Whether you prefer pre-lit Christmas garlands for convenience, or unlit styles for flexibility, or flocked garland to mimic freshly fallen snow, each Carol's Christmas Conifers artificial Christmas garland is crafted with attention to detail and quality materials.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our collection of artificial Christmas garlands to find the perfect finishing touch for your space this holiday season.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat is an artificial garland? \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eA faux garland is a strand of evergreen foliage designed to replicate the appearance of real greenery without the maintenance. Made from a mix of PE and PVC, these artificial Christmas garlands offer a realistic look while remaining durable and reusable year after year. \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat is the best artificial garland?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe best artificial Christmas garland depends on your decorating style and where you plan to use it. Many customers prefer realistic garlands for a more natural look and fuller appearance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur most popular garlands are inspired by our best-selling artificial Christmas tree designs, such as the \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/royal-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003eRoyal\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" title=\"King Fraser Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"/\/collections\/king-fraser-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\"\u003eKing Fraser Fir\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThese styles are known for their lifelike foliage and premium construction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePre-lit garlands are ideal for convenience, while unlit options offer more flexibility for customization. Flocked garlands are also a popular choice for creating a winter-inspired look to match their \u003ca style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" title=\"King Flock Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"/\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKing Flock\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e or \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" title=\"Queen Flock Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"/\/collections\/queen-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\"\u003eQueen Flock\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e Christmas tree. Explore our best selling wreaths and garlands to find the perfect fit for your decor. \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhere can you place garland?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eArtificial Christmas garlands are highly versatile and can be used throughout your home. Common placements include draped over mantels, wrapped around stair railings, and used to frame doorways or windows. Garland can also be styled along tabletops, shelves, or entryways to add texture and seasonal detail.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow do you decorate garland?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eArtificial Christmas garland can be styled simply or layered for a more decorative look. Many appear beautiful on their own, but can also be enhanced with lights, \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca title=\"Christmas Ribbons\" href=\"/\/collections\/ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca title=\"Christmas Ornaments\" href=\"/\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, or seasonal accents like pinecones and picks. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFor a cohesive look, match your garland to your Christmas tree or wreath, or layer multiple garlands to create added fullness and dimensional.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat types of garlands are there?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eArtificial Christmas garlands come in several styles:\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cp role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eClassic green garlands for a traditional look\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cp role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFlocked garlands for a snow-fallen whimsical effect\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cp role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePre-lit garlands for built-in lighting, available in:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" aria-level=\"2\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cp role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eBattery-Operated pre-lit garlands, which are cordless and do not require an outlet\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" aria-level=\"2\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cp role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePlug-Operated pre-lit garlands, which connect to a power source for continuous lighting\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cp role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eUnlit garlands for full customization and lighting autonomy\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow long should a Christmas garland be?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe ideal garland length depends on where you plan to display it. Most artificial Christmas garlands are available in standard lengths such as 6 feet or 9 feet, which work well for common spaces like mantels and tabletops. Carol's Christmas Conifers garlands are typically 9 feet long and come available in widths such as 10 \u0026amp; 12 inches for a fuller, realistic look.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFor railings or doorways, measure your space and allow for slight draping. For a fuller look, try layering multiple garlands or adding tree picks for extra depth and dimension.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow do you hang a garland?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eGarlands can be hung using hooks, adhesive clips, ribbon, or zip ties depending on the placement. Once installed, adjust and shape the branches to ensure an even, natural-looking display.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow do you store an artificial garland?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eTo keep your artificial Christmas garland looking its best, store it in a cool, dry place after the holiday season. Gently reshape the branches before storing and avoid compressing the garland to maintain its fullness over time.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eArtificial Christmas garlands are an easy way to add warmth, texture, and festive detail throughout your home. Explore our collection to find a Christmas garland that complements your tree, wreaths, and holiday décor for a cohesive and elevated seasonal look. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"9-ft-by-12-king-flock-garland-unlit","title":"9' x 12\" King Flock® Garland Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eYour winter wonderland collection shouldn't just end at your tree. Bring the enchantment of a dreamy white forest right into your living room, while decorating this holiday season. From our critically acclaimed King flock tree, we present the King Flock Garland. Composed of the same realistic tips and snow-covered branches, the King Flock Garland beautifully compliments our \u003cspan style=\"color: #008000;\"\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: #008000;\" href=\"/\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKing Flock Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e. Our Garland makes for an effortless and quick shaping process. The flexible material makes it easy to wrap through a banister, hang around the fireplace, or around a door frame. The King Flock Garland is a sure way to complete your holiday home decor that's only fit for a king. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' x 12\" \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642908733504,"sku":"KF-G-9x12-U","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFlock-2.jpg?v=1718159073"},{"product_id":"9-ft-by-12-king-flock-garland-led","title":"9' x 12\" King Flock® Garland with LED Lights (Battery Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eYour winter wonderland collection shouldn't just end at your tree. Bring the enchantment of a dreamy white forest right into your living room, while decorating this holiday season. From our critically acclaimed King flock tree, we present the King Flock Garland. Composed of the same realistic tips and snow-covered branches, the King Flock Garland beautifully compliments our \u003cspan style=\"color: #008000;\"\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: #008000;\" href=\"/\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKing Flock Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e. Our Garland makes for an effortless and quick shaping process. The flexible material makes it easy to wrap through a banister, hang around the fireplace, or around a door frame. The King Flock Garland is a sure way to complete your holiday home decor that's only fit for a king.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' x 12\" \/ Battery LED","offer_id":28642909061184,"sku":"KF-G-Bat-9x12-L","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFlock-2_ed28911f-2c3f-44a1-8644-99e202e04f15.jpg?v=1718159132"},{"product_id":"9-foot-x-10-royal-fir-garland-unlit","title":"9' x 10\" Royal Fir Garland Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhy settle for less this holiday season when you can celebrate in grand style. Add a breathtaking and elegant looking garland to your home decor when you choose the Royal Fir Garland to grace your home this holiday season. This stunning and magnificent garland is full-bodied and features realistic green foliage that creates a beautiful and life-like display. The Royal Fir wreath was inspired by our royal fir tree which features a high-end design for the ultimate Christmas tree display.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAppropriate for indoor and outdoor use, the flexible material makes it easy to wrap through a banister, hang around the fireplace, or around a door frame. Create a warm ambiance and elegant Christmas display right inside your home with the majestic and striking Royal Fir garland.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642945237056,"sku":"RF-G9x10-U","price":79.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021RoyalFir-2.jpg?v=1718159242"},{"product_id":"9-foot-x-12-cypress-spruce-garland-unlit","title":"9' x 12\"  Cypress Spruce Garland Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eSpruce up the ambiance in your home this season with the Cypress Spruce Garland. Inspired by our prestigious \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/cypress-spruce-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCypress Spruce Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, this garland will be hard not to notice. Designed with the same tasteful blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) as the Cypress Spruce tree, resulting in an impressive and beautiful Christmas garland.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAppropriate for indoor and outdoor use. The flexible material makes it easy to wrap through a banister, hang around the fireplace, or around a door frame. Create a warm and elegant Christmas display right inside your home with the majestic and eye-catching Cypress Spruce garland. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642950676544,"sku":"CS-G9x12-U","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021CypressSpruce-4.jpg?v=1718159246"},{"product_id":"9ft-12inch-tribeca-spruce-blue-garland-unlit","title":"9' x 12\" Tribeca Blue Spruce Garland Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Tribeca Blue Spruce Garland features a beautiful foliage color tone that compliments our \u003cspan style=\"color: #008080;\"\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: #008080;\" href=\"/\/collections\/tribeca-spruce-artificial-christmas-tree\/blue?sort_by=price-ascending\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTribeca Blue Spruce Tree.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e Inspired by the Colorado and Utah State tree, our Tribeca Blue Spruce Garland features tasteful blue-green needles and a brown stem for a life-like display. Perfect for indoor and outdoor use, the flexible material makes it easy to wrap through a banister, hang around the fireplace, or around a door frame. The Tribeca Blue Spruce Garland is an excellent choice when setting a festive atmosphere this holiday season for your family and friends.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642951987264,"sku":"TBS-G9x12-U","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021BlueSpruce-2.jpg?v=1718159152"},{"product_id":"9-ft-by-12-king-flock-garland-led-plug","title":"9' x 12\" King Flock® Garland with LED Lights (Plug Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eYour winter wonderland collection shouldn't just end at your tree. Bring the enchantment of a dreamy white forest right into your living room, while decorating this holiday season. From our critically acclaimed King flock tree, we present the King Flock Garland. Composed of the same realistic tips and snow-covered branches, the King Flock Garland beautifully compliments our \u003cspan style=\"color: #008000;\"\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: #008000;\" href=\"/\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKing Flock Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e. Our Garland makes for an effortless and quick shaping process. The flexible material makes it easy to wrap through a banister, hang around the fireplace, or around a door frame. The King Flock Garland is a sure way to complete your holiday home decor that's only fit for a king.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' x 12\" \/ Plug LED","offer_id":40284858482888,"sku":"KF-Plug-G-9x12-L","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFlock-2_4c3f8c0f-8375-4752-b5ad-ccbeedf75f18.jpg?v=1718159125"},{"product_id":"9ft-12inch-king-noble-fir-garland-led","title":"9' x 12\" King Noble Fir Garland with Warm White LED Lights (Plug Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe great thing about adding more garlands to your holiday oasis? The versatile decorating possibilities that come with it. Whether you already have one of our signature King Noble Christmas Trees or not, the beautiful King Noble Garland offers the instant upgrade you need to enhance any holiday setting. 9 feet in length and 12” wide, this dense and expansive garland is sure to compliment your décor year after year. With a blend of realistic and classic needle tips, this garland radiates genuine Christmas tradition that will endure decades of memories! The King Noble Garland sits perfectly on your stair railing, fireplace mantel, doorway, or anywhere else you’d like to drape some elegant Christmas spirit this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42788290166984,"sku":"KNF-G9x12-Plug","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingNobleGarland1_0ba166b7-ec51-45d3-b999-8961ea726c6d.jpg?v=1714673633"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/1300x160-8_ff5fbc2e-fad3-4fe1-be73-276a7a28b8fd.jpg?v=1722012065","url":"/\/collections\/artificial-christmas-garlands.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}